{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116885","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116885/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116885/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116885/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116885","id":4004528780,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HAHx8","number":116885,"title":"Fix different behavior between debug and release exports for invalid `await` on runtime null","user":{"login":"Scrawach","id":40476180,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDc2MTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40476180?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach","html_url":"https://github.com/Scrawach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-02-28T11:52:21Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T12:46:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116885","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116885.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116885.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105153\r\n\r\n## Result\r\n\r\n**DEBUG** Build:\r\n```\r\nStart loop\r\nERROR: Parameter \"data.tree\" is null.\r\n   at: get_tree (scene/main/node.h:485)\r\nSCRIPT ERROR: Invalid access to property or key 'process_frame' on a base object of type 'null instance'.\r\n          at: _process (res://node.gd:17)\r\n```\r\n\r\n**RELEASE** Build:\r\n```\r\nStart loop\r\nERROR: Parameter \"data.tree\" is null.\r\n   at: Node::get_tree (.\\scene/main/node.h:548)\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>GDScript code example</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nvar _run_loop = 5\r\n# Setting this to true triggers the bug in this example.\r\nvar _remove_from_tree = true\r\n\r\nfunc do_stuff():\r\n\tprint(\"Did stuff\")\r\n\r\nfunc _process(delta):\r\n\tif _remove_from_tree and get_parent():\r\n\t\tget_parent().remove_child(self)\r\n\r\n\tprint(\"Start loop\")\r\n\r\n\twhile _run_loop > 0:\r\n\t\tawait get_tree().process_frame\r\n\t\tdo_stuff()\r\n\t\t_run_loop -= 1\r\n\r\n\tprint(\"End loop\")\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nIt's issue not about `await`. GDScript virtual machine behaves differently in `debug` and `release` exports. `Debug` stops code execution after error, but `release` sometimes doesn't check errors (and not stop). Solution is add checks for operations and terminate execution if an error occurs for `release` export too.\r\n\r\nHowever, `release` export don't generate `SCRIPT ERROR`. Although, in my opinion, it would be nice to see `SCRIPT ERROR` in `release` export too. But I decided to maintain previous behavior.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116885/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116885/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}